---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import AssetImage from '../../components/AssetImage.astro';
import { assets, pages } from '../../data/site';

const page = pages['get-involved'];
const [learn, contribute, collaborate, support] = page.sections;
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Get Involved with New Earth | Learn, Contribute and Collaborate"
  description="Find a clear way to engage with New Earth through learning, contribution, collaboration or practical support."
  canonical="/get-involved/"
>
  <article class="involved-page">
    <header class="page-hero shell involved-page__hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">Begin where you are</p>
      <h1>{page.title}</h1>
      <p class="lede">{page.intro} You do not have to wait for a finished system or a large organisation to begin taking thoughtful action where you already are.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="involved-page__start" aria-labelledby="start-where-title">
      <div class="shell">
        <p class="eyebrow">A practical invitation</p>
        <h2 id="start-where-title">Start where you are</h2>
        <p class="involved-page__lead">Care for what is close, learn what is useful, and let action grow through cooperation.</p>
        <ol class="involved-page__path" aria-label="Participation pathway">
          <li><strong>Care</strong><span>Notice what is around you and look after your wellbeing, home, resources and place.</span></li>
          <li><strong>Learn</strong><span>Build useful knowledge and understand the systems you depend on.</span></li>
          <li><strong>Contribute</strong><span>Share skills, experience, ideas or practical help.</span></li>
          <li><strong>Build locally</strong><span>Strengthen useful capacity in your home or community.</span></li>
          <li><strong>Connect</strong><span>Share what works and cooperate with others.</span></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section involved-page__ways" aria-labelledby="ways-title">
      <div class="shell">
        <p class="eyebrow">Choose a route</p>
        <h2 id="ways-title">Ways to take part</h2>
        <div class="involved-page__cards">
          <article class="involved-page__card">
            <p class="eyebrow">Learn</p>
            <h3>{learn[0]}</h3>
            <p>{learn[1]} Learning is a valid first step.</p>
            <a class="text-link" href="/vision/">Start with the Vision</a>
          </article>
          <article class="involved-page__card">
            <p class="eyebrow">Contribute</p>
            <h3>{contribute[0]}</h3>
            <p>{contribute[1]}</p>
            <a class="text-link" href="/projects/">Explore practical work</a>
          </article>
          <article class="involved-page__card">
            <p class="eyebrow">Collaborate</p>
            <h3>{collaborate[0]}</h3>
            <p>{collaborate[1].replace(' through Collaboration', ' through the public Ecosystem')}</p>
            <a class="text-link" href="/ecosystem/">See how the parts connect</a>
          </article>
          <article class="involved-page__card">
            <p class="eyebrow">Support</p>
            <h3>{support[0]}</h3>
            <p>{support[1]}</p>
            <a class="text-link" href="/projects/">Follow developing work</a>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section-sand involved-page__local" aria-labelledby="build-locally-title">
      <div class="shell involved-page__local-inner">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Local capability</p>
          <h2 id="build-locally-title">Build where you are</h2>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p>New Earth starts with people taking thoughtful responsibility for their own place: their wellbeing, skills, food, resources, environment and community.</p>
          <p>That might mean growing some food, learning a useful skill, helping a neighbour, improving a shared space, documenting local knowledge or starting a useful conversation. These are invitations, not requirements.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section involved-page__community" aria-labelledby="connect-title">
      <div class="shell involved-page__community-inner">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Open cooperation</p>
          <h2 id="connect-title">Connect with others</h2>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p>Local-first does not mean isolated. People and communities can share learning, cooperate, offer mutual support and connect outward while retaining meaningful local agency.</p>
          <p>Future community pathways may help people connect locally. They would need to remain small, locally shaped, community-led, responsible, transparent and connected outward rather than centrally controlled.</p>
          <article class="image-content-card builders-card">
            <div>
              <span class="status">Independent community platform</span>
              <h3>New Earth Builders</h3>
              <p>An intentional community connecting innovators, healers, inventors and creators who want to collaborate, exchange knowledge and help bring New Earth-aligned projects into being.</p>
              <a class="text-link" href="https://new-earth-builders.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit New Earth Builders <span aria-hidden="true">(external)</span></a>
            </div>
            <AssetImage asset={assets.builders} alt="New Earth Builders logo" className="builders-logo" />
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section involved-page__work" aria-labelledby="work-title">
      <div class="shell">
        <p class="eyebrow">Keep exploring</p>
        <h2 id="work-title">Explore practical work</h2>
        <p class="involved-page__lead">See where selected projects currently stand, and follow questions and learning as the work develops.</p>
        <nav class="page-actions" aria-label="Explore practical work">
          <a class="button" href="/projects/">Explore Projects</a>
          <a class="button" href="/blueprint/">Read the Blueprint</a>
          <a class="button" href="/ecosystem/">Visit the Ecosystem</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .involved-page__hero { padding-block: clamp(5rem, 11vw, 8rem) clamp(3.5rem, 7vw, 5rem); }
  .involved-page__hero .lede { max-width: 48rem; }
  .involved-page__start { padding-block: clamp(3.5rem, 7vw, 6rem); background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--sage), var(--ivory)); border-block: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .involved-page__start h2, .involved-page__ways h2, .involved-page__local h2, .involved-page__community h2, .involved-page__work h2 { max-width: 18ch; }
  .involved-page__lead { max-width: 58ch; font: 700 clamp(1.2rem, 2vw, 1.5rem)/1.4 var(--serif); color: var(--deep); }
  .involved-page__path { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: .75rem; margin: 2.5rem 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .involved-page__path li { min-width: 0; padding: 1.1rem; border-top: 3px solid var(--teal); background: rgb(255 255 255 / .72); }
  .involved-page__path strong { display: block; margin-bottom: .45rem; color: var(--deep); }
  .involved-page__path span { display: block; font-size: .9rem; line-height: 1.5; }
  .involved-page__ways { background: var(--ivory); }
  .involved-page__cards { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
  .involved-page__card { padding: 1.75rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); background: rgb(255 255 255 / .72); box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
  .involved-page__card h3 { margin-bottom: .75rem; }
  .involved-page__card .eyebrow { margin: 0; }
  .involved-page__card .text-link { display: inline-block; margin-top: .75rem; }
  .involved-page__local-inner, .involved-page__community-inner { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, .8fr) minmax(0, 1.2fr); gap: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 6rem); align-items: start; }
  .involved-page__work { padding-bottom: 7rem; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .involved-page__path { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); } }
  @media (max-width: 680px) { .involved-page__cards, .involved-page__local-inner, .involved-page__community-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .involved-page__path { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .involved-page__builders { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .involved-page__builders-logo { max-width: 12rem; justify-self: center; } }
</style>
